"type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i11","start":164,"end":173},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b0-0-p4-i12","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i12","start":175,"end":186},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b0-0-p4-i15","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i15","start":188,"end":237},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b0-0-p4-i17","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i17","start":239,"end":287},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b0-0-p4-i20","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i20","start":288,"end":339},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b0-0-p4-i22","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i22","start":341,"end":390},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b0-0-p4-i24","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i24","start":391,"end":436},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b0-0-p4-i26","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i26","start":437,"end":482}],"metadata":{"folio":{"kind":"paragraph","frame":{"x":72,"y":66.23,"width":218.28,"height":131.85},"fontSize":10.91,"lineCount":10,"leading":13.55,"family":"serif","align":"left"}}},"inline":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input/Output Representations To make BERT handle a variety of down-stream tasks, our input representation is able to unambiguously represent both a single sentence and a pair of sentences (e.g., h Question, Answeri) in one token sequence. Throughout this work, a \"sentence\" can be an arbitrary span of contiguous text, rather than an actual linguistic sentence. A \"sequence\" refers to the input token sequence to BERT, which may be a single sentence or two sentences packed together."}]},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0","type":"standoff-editor-block","properties":{"standoffProperties":[{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i28","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i28","start":0,"end":15},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i29","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i29","start":17,"end":26},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i30","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i30","start":28,"end":33},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i31","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i31","start":35,"end":38},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i34","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i34","start":40,"end":76},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i35","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i35","start":78,"end":86},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i37","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i37","start":88,"end":135},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i39","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i39","start":136,"end":145},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i40","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i40","start":147,"end":183},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i42","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i42","start":185,"end":197},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i43","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i43","start":199,"end":200},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i44","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i44","start":202,"end":205},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i45","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i45","start":207,"end":211},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i46","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i46","start":213,"end":214},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i47","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i47","start":216,"end":219},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i48","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i48","start":221,"end":222},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i49","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i49","start":224,"end":226},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i50","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i50","start":228,"end":229},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i59","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i59","start":230,"end":279},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i66","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i66","start":281,"end":286},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i67","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i67","start":288,"end":328},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i69","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i69","start":330,"end":379},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i71","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i71","start":381,"end":389},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i72","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i72","start":391,"end":428},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i76","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i76","start":430,"end":474},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i78","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i78","start":475,"end":523},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i82","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i82","start":525,"end":574},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i84","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i84","start":576,"end":623},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i87","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i87","start":625,"end":683},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i89","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i89","start":685,"end":740},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b1-0-p4-i91","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i91","start":742,"end":771}],"metadata":{"folio":{"kind":"paragraph","frame":{"x":72,"y":202.34,"width":218.28,"height":213.05},"fontSize":10.91,"lineCount":16,"leading":13.55,"family":"serif","align":"left"}}},"inline":[{"kind":"text","text":"We use WordPiece embeddings (Wu et al., 2016) with a 30,000 token vocabulary. The first token of every sequence is always a special classification token ([CLS]). The final hidden state corresponding to this token is used as the aggregate sequence representation for classification tasks. Sentence pairs are packed together into a single sequence. We differentiate the sentences in two ways. First, we separate them with a special token ([SEP]). Second, we add a learned embedding to every token indicating whether it belongs to sentence A or sentence B. As shown in Figure 1, we denote input embedding as E, the final hidden vector of the special [CLS] token as $C\\in \\mathbb{R}^{H}$, and the final hidden vector for the $i^{th}$ input token as $T_{i}\\in \\mathbb{R}^{H}$ ."}]},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b2-0","type":"standoff-editor-block","properties":{"standoffProperties":[{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b2-0-p4-i94","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i94","start":0,"end":17},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b2-0-p4-i95","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i95","start":19,"end":21},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b2-0-p4-i96","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i96","start":23,"end":27},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b2-0-p4-i97","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i97","start":29,"end":42},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b2-0-p4-i98","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i98","start":44,"end":45},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b2-0-p4-i101","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i101","start":47,"end":93},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b2-0-p4-i104","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i104","start":95,"end":127},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b2-0-p4-i105","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i105","start":129,"end":139},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b2-0-p4-i107","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i107","start":140,"end":189}],"metadata":{"folio":{"kind":"paragraph","frame":{"x":72,"y":419.66,"width":218.27,"height":50.47},"fontSize":10.91,"lineCount":4,"leading":13.55,"family":"serif","align":"left"}}},"inline":[{"kind":"text","text":"For a given token, its input representation is constructed by summing the corresponding token, segment, and position embeddings. A visualization of this construction can be seen in Figure 2."}]},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b3-0","type":"standoff-editor-block","properties":{"standoffProperties":[{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b3-0-p4-i114","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i114","start":0,"end":2},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b3-0-bold-p4-i114","type":"style/bold","start":0,"end":2},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b3-0-p4-i115","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i115","start":4,"end":20},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b3-0-bold-p4-i115","type":"style/bold","start":4,"end":20}],"metadata":{"folio":{"kind":"heading","frame":{"x":72,"y":484.45,"width":113.91,"height":9.82},"fontSize":10.91,"lineCount":1,"leading":12.33,"family":"serif","align":"left"}}},"inline":[{"kind":"text","text":"3.1 Pre-training BERT"}]},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-0","type":"standoff-editor-block","properties":{"standoffProperties":[{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-0-p4-i117","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i117","start":0,"end":15},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-0-p4-i118","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i118","start":17,"end":19},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-0-p4-i119","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i119","start":21,"end":27},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-0-p4-i120","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i120","start":29,"end":46},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-0-p4-i122","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i122","start":48,"end":97},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-0-p4-i124","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i124","start":99,"end":111},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-0-p4-i125","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i125","start":113,"end":146},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-0-p4-i127","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i127","start":148,"end":155},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-0-p4-i128","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i128","start":157,"end":191},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-0-p4-i132","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i132","start":192,"end":216},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-0-p4-i133","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i133","start":218,"end":221},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-0-p4-i134","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i134","start":223,"end":230},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-0-p4-i135","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i135","start":232,"end":240},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-0-p4-i140","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i140","start":242,"end":283}],"metadata":{"folio":{"kind":"paragraph","frame":{"x":72,"y":503.07,"width":218.29,"height":77.56},"fontSize":10.91,"lineCount":6,"leading":13.55,"family":"serif","align":"left"}}},"inline":[{"kind":"text","text":"Unlike Peters et al. (2018a) and Radford et al. (2018), we do not use traditional left-to-right or right-to-left language models to pre-train BERT. Instead, we pre-train BERT using two unsupervised tasks, described in this section. This step is presented in the left part of Figure 1."}]},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-1","type":"standoff-editor-block","properties":{"standoffProperties":[{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-1-p4-i147","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i147","start":0,"end":17},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-1-bold-p4-i147","type":"style/bold","start":0,"end":17},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-1-p4-i148","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i148","start":19,"end":30},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-1-p4-i149","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i149","start":32,"end":33},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-1-p4-i150","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i150","start":35,"end":36},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-1-p4-i151","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i151","start":38,"end":43},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-1-p4-i154","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i154","start":44,"end":93},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-1-p4-i156","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i156","start":95,"end":102},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-1-p4-i157","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i157","start":104,"end":144},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-1-p4-i159","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i159","start":146,"end":192},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-1-p4-i161","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i161","start":193,"end":197},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-1-p4-i162","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i162","start":199,"end":203},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-1-p4-i163","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i163","start":205,"end":217},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-1-p4-i164","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i164","start":219,"end":224},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-1-p4-i165","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i165","start":226,"end":239},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-1-p4-i167","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i167","start":241,"end":288},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-1-p4-i174","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i174","start":290,"end":342},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-1-p4-i178","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i178","start":343,"end":389},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-1-p4-i185","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i185","start":390,"end":441},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b4-1-p4-i187","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i187","start":443,"end":493}],"metadata":{"folio":{"kind":"paragraph","frame":{"x":72,"y":593.38,"width":218.28,"height":131.95},"fontSize":10.91,"lineCount":10,"leading":13.55,"family":"serif","align":"left"}}},"inline":[{"kind":"text","text":"Task #1: Masked LM Intuitively, it is reasonable to believe that a deep bidirectional model is strictly more powerful than either a left-to-right model or the shallow concatenation of a left-toright and a right-to-left model. Unfortunately, standard conditional language models can only be trained left-to-right or right-to-left, since bidirectional conditioning would allow each word to indirectly \"see itself\", and the model could trivially predict the target word in a multi-layered context."}]},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b5-0","type":"standoff-editor-block","properties":{"standoffProperties":[{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b5-0-p4-i196","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i196","start":0,"end":59},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b5-0-p4-i199","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i199","start":61,"end":122},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b5-0-p4-i202","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i202","start":124,"end":173}],"metadata":{"folio":{"kind":"paragraph","frame":{"x":72,"y":736.92,"width":218.29,"height":27.99},"fontSize":8.97,"lineCount":3,"leading":9.96,"family":"serif","align":"left"}}},"inline":[{"kind":"text","text":"former is often referred to as a \"Transformer encoder\" while the left-context-only version is referred to as a \"Transformer decoder\" since it can be used for text generation."}]},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b7-0","type":"standoff-editor-block","properties":{"standoffProperties":[{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b7-0-p4-i2","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i2","start":0,"end":48},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b7-0-p4-i4","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i4","start":49,"end":97},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b7-0-p4-i6","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i6","start":99,"end":145},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b7-0-p4-i13","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i13","start":147,"end":153},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b7-0-p4-i14","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i14","start":155,"end":193},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b7-0-p4-i16","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i16","start":195,"end":242},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b7-0-p4-i18","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i18","start":244,"end":287},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b7-0-italics-p4-i18","type":"style/italics","start":244,"end":287},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b7-0-p4-i19","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i19","start":289,"end":295},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b7-0-p4-i21","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i21","start":297,"end":347},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b7-0-p4-i23","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i23","start":349,"end":395},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b7-0-p4-i25","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i25","start":397,"end":446},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b7-0-p4-i27","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i27","start":448,"end":491},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b7-0-p4-i32","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i32","start":492,"end":523},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b7-0-p4-i33","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i33","start":525,"end":538},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b7-0-p4-i36","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i36","start":540,"end":589},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b7-0-p4-i38","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i38","start":591,"end":637},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b7-0-p4-i41","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i41","start":638,"end":664}],"metadata":{"folio":{"kind":"paragraph","frame":{"x":307.28,"y":66.32,"width":218.29,"height":185.96},"fontSize":10.91,"lineCount":14,"leading":13.55,"family":"serif","align":"left"}}},"inline":[{"kind":"text","text":"In order to train a deep bidirectional representation, we simply mask some percentage of the input tokens at random, and then predict those masked tokens. We refer to this procedure as a \"masked LM\" (MLM), although it is often referred to as a Cloze task in the literature (Taylor, 1953). In this case, the final hidden vectors corresponding to the mask tokens are fed into an output softmax over the vocabulary, as in a standard LM. In all of our experiments, we mask 15% of all WordPiece tokens in each sequence at random. In contrast to denoising auto-encoders (Vincent et al., 2008), we only predict the masked words rather than reconstructing the entire input."}]},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0","type":"standoff-editor-block","properties":{"standoffProperties":[{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i51","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i51","start":0,"end":7},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i52","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i52","start":9,"end":12},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i53","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i53","start":14,"end":19},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i54","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i54","start":21,"end":22},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i55","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i55","start":24,"end":25},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i56","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i56","start":27,"end":32},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i57","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i57","start":34,"end":34},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i58","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i58","start":36,"end":42},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i60","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i60","start":43,"end":48},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i61","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i61","start":50,"end":60},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i62","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i62","start":62,"end":67},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i63","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i63","start":69,"end":81},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i64","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i64","start":83,"end":86},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i65","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i65","start":88,"end":89},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i68","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i68","start":91,"end":138},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i70","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i70","start":140,"end":186},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i73","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i73","start":187,"end":210},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i74","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i74","start":212,"end":228},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i75","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i75","start":230,"end":234},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i77","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i77","start":236,"end":280},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i79","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i79","start":281,"end":284},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i80","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i80","start":286,"end":298},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i81","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i81","start":300,"end":326},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i83","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i83","start":328,"end":375},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i85","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i85","start":377,"end":387},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i86","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i86","start":389,"end":427},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i88","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i88","start":429,"end":475},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i90","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i90","start":477,"end":523},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i92","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i92","start":525,"end":565},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i93","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i93","start":567,"end":571},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i99","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i99","start":573,"end":579},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i100","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i100","start":581,"end":627},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i102","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i102","start":629,"end":647},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i103","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i103","start":649,"end":677},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b8-0-p4-i106","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i106","start":679,"end":704}],"metadata":{"folio":{"kind":"paragraph","frame":{"x":307.28,"y":256.01,"width":218.81,"height":199.5},"fontSize":10.91,"lineCount":15,"leading":13.55,"family":"serif","align":"left"}}},"inline":[{"kind":"text","text":"Although this allows us to obtain a bidirectional pre-trained model, a downside is that we are creating a mismatch between pre-training and fine-tuning, since the [MASK] token does not appear during fine-tuning. To mitigate this, we do not always replace \"masked\" words with the actual [MASK] token. The training data generator chooses 15% of the token positions at random for prediction. If the i-th token is chosen, we replace the i-th token with (1) the [MASK] token 80% of the time (2) a random token 10% of the time (3) the unchanged i-th token 10% of the time. Then, $T_{i}$ will be used to predict the original token with cross entropy loss. We compare variations of this procedure in Appendix C.2."}]},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b9-0","type":"standoff-editor-block","properties":{"standoffProperties":[{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b9-0-p4-i108","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i108","start":0,"end":3},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b9-0-bold-p4-i108","type":"style/bold","start":0,"end":3},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b9-0-p4-i109","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i109","start":5,"end":7},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b9-0-bold-p4-i109","type":"style/bold","start":5,"end":7},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b9-0-p4-i110","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p4-i110","start":9,"end":12},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p4-b9-0-bold-p4-i110","type":"style/bold",