","start":750,"end":761},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p6-b12-0-p6-i167","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p6-i167","start":763,"end":777},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p6-b12-0-p6-i168","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p6-i168","start":779,"end":790},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p6-b12-0-p6-i169","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p6-i169","start":792,"end":793},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p6-b12-0-p6-i172","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p6-i172","start":795,"end":844},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p6-b12-0-p6-i173","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p6-i173","start":846,"end":886},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p6-b12-0-p6-i179","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p6-i179","start":888,"end":933},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p6-b12-0-p6-i185","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p6-i185","start":935,"end":981},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p6-b12-0-p6-i190","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p6-i190","start":983,"end":1009},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p6-b12-0-p6-i191","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p6-i191","start":1011,"end":1012},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p6-b12-0-p6-i192","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p6-i192","start":1014,"end":1018},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p6-b12-0-p6-i193","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p6-i193","start":1020,"end":1029},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p6-b12-0-p6-i202","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p6-i202","start":1031,"end":1073},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p6-b12-0-p6-i205","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p6-i205","start":1074,"end":1121}],"metadata":{"folio":{"kind":"paragraph","frame":{"x":307.28,"y":421.4,"width":218.27,"height":310.32},"fontSize":10.91,"lineCount":23,"leading":13.55,"family":"serif","align":"left"}}},"inline":[{"kind":"text","text":"The analogous formula is used for the end of the answer span. The score of a candidate span from position i to position j is defined as $S\\cdot T_{i}+E\\cdot T_{j}$ , and the maximum scoring span where j ≥ i is used as a prediction. The training objective is the sum of the log-likelihoods of the correct start and end positions. We fine-tune for 3 epochs with a learning rate of 5e-5 and a batch size of 32. Table 2 shows top leaderboard entries as well as results from top published systems (Seo et al., 2017; Clark and Gardner, 2018; Peters et al., 2018a; Hu et al., 2018). The top results from the SQuAD leaderboard do not have up-to-date public system descriptions available,11 and are allowed to use any public data when training their systems. We therefore use modest data augmentation in our system by first fine-tuning on TriviaQA (Joshi et al., 2017) befor fine-tuning on SQuAD. Our best performing system outperforms the top leaderboard system by +1.5 F1 in ensembling and +1.3 F1 as a single system. In fact, our single BERT model outperforms the top ensemble system in terms of F1 score. Without TriviaQA fine-"}]},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p6-b13-0","type":"standoff-editor-block","properties":{"standoffProperties":[{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p6-b13-0-p6-i209","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p6-i209","start":0,"end":1},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p6-b13-0-p6-i210","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p6-i210","start":2,"end":55},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p6-b13-0-p6-i213","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p6-i213","start":57,"end":101}],"metadata":{"folio":{"kind":"paragraph","frame":{"x":307.28,"y":745.14,"width":218.27,"height":19.77},"fontSize":8.97,"lineCount":2,"leading":11.7,"family":"serif","align":"left"}}},"inline":[{"kind":"text","text":"11QANet is described in Yu et al. (2018), but the system has improved substantially after publication."}]},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p6-b9-0","type":"standoff-editor-block","properties":{"standoffProperties":[{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p6-b9-0-p6-i214","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p6-i214","start":0,"end":3}],"metadata":{"folio":{"kind"