"p7-i142","start":545,"end":569}],"metadata":{"folio":{"kind":"paragraph","frame":{"x":307.28,"y":242.29,"width":218.29,"height":160.14},"fontSize":10.91,"lineCount":12,"leading":13.55,"family":"serif","align":"left"}}},"inline":[{"kind":"text","text":"$s_{\\hat{i},j}=\\max _{j\\geq i}S\\cdot T_{i}+E\\cdot T_{j}$. We predict a non-null answer when $s_{\\hat{i},j}>s_{null}+\\tau$, where the threshold τ is selected on the dev set to maximize F1. We did not use TriviaQA data for this model. We fine-tuned for 2 epochs with a learning rate of 5e-5 and a batch size of 48. The results compared to prior leaderboard entries and top published work (Sun et al., 2018; Wang et al., 2018b) are shown in Table 3, excluding systems that use BERT as one of their components. We observe a +5.1 F1 improvement over the previous best system."}]},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p7-b33-0","type":"standoff-editor-block","properties":{"standoffProperties":[{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p7-b33-0-p7-i149","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p7-i149","start":0,"end":2},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p7-b33-0-bold-p7-i149","type":"style/bold","start":0,"end":2},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p7-b33-0-p7-i150","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p7-i150","start":4,"end":7},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p7-b33-0-bold-p7-i150","type":"style/bold","start":4,"end":7}],"metadata":{"folio":{"kind":"heading","frame":{"x":307.28,"y":416.81,"width":55.97,"height":9.83},"fontSize":10.91,"lineCount":1,"leading":12.33,"family":"serif","align":"left"}}},"inline":[{"kind":"text","text":"4.4 SWAG"}]},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p7-b34-0","type":"standoff-editor-block","properties":{"standoffProperties":[{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p7-b34-0-p7-i151","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p7-i151","start":0,"end":2},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p7-b34-0-p7-i152","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p7-i152","start":4,"end":13},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p7-b34-0-p7-i153","ty