":947},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p8-b12-0-p8-i147","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p8-i147","start":949,"end":955},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p8-b12-0-p8-i149","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p8-i149","start":957,"end":1007},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p8-b12-0-p8-i151","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p8-i151","start":1009,"end":1010},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p8-b12-0-p8-i152","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p8-i152","start":1012,"end":1017},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p8-b12-0-p8-i153","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p8-i153","start":1019,"end":1024},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p8-b12-0-p8-i154","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p8-i154","start":1026,"end":1034},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p8-b12-0-p8-i155","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p8-i155","start":1036,"end":1050},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p8-b12-0-p8-i161","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p8-i161","start":1052,"end":1067},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p8-b12-0-p8-i162","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p8-i162","start":1069,"end":1074},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p8-b12-0-p8-i163","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p8-i163","start":1076,"end":1087},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p8-b12-0-p8-i164","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p8-i164","start":1089,"end":1097},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p8-b12-0-p8-i166","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p8-i166","start":1099,"end":1141},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p8-b12-0-p8-i170","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p8-i170","start":1142,"end":1163}],"metadata":{"folio":{"kind":"paragraph","frame":{"x":307.28,"y":278.33,"width":218.29,"height":336.47},"fontSize":10.91,"lineCount":25,"leading":13.55,"family":"serif","align":"left"}}},"inline":[{"kind":"text","text":"In this section, we explore the effect of model size on fine-tuning task accuracy. We trained a number of BERT models with a differing number of layers, hidden units, and attention heads, while otherwise using the same hyperparameters and training procedure as described previously. Results on selected GLUE tasks are shown in Table 6. In this table, we report the average Dev Set accuracy from 5 random restarts of fine-tuning. We can see that larger models lead to a strict accuracy improvement across all four datasets, even for MRPC which only has 3,600 labeled training examples, and is substantially different from the pre-training tasks. It is also perhaps surprising that we are able to achieve such significant improvements on top of models which are already quite large relative to the existing literature. For example, the largest Transformer explored in Vaswani et al. (2017) is (L=6, H=1024, A=16) with 100M parameters for the encoder, and the largest Transformer we have found in the literature is (L=64, H=512, A=2) with 235M parameters (Al-Rfou et al., 2018). By contrast, BERT BASE contains 110M parameters and BERT LARGE contains 340M parameters."}]},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p8-b13-0","type":"standoff-editor-block","properties":{"standoffProperties":[{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p8-b13-0-p8-i173","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p8-i173","start":0,"end":1},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p8-b13-0-p8-i174","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p8-i174","start":3,"end":5},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p8-b13-0-p8-i175","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p8-i175","start":7,"end":10},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p8-b13-0-p8-i176","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p8-i176","start":12,"end":15},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p8-b13-0-p8-i177","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p8-i177","start":17,"end":21},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p8-b13-0-p8-i178","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p8-i178","start":23,"end":26},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p8-b13-0-p8-i179","type":"spatial/source-run","value":"p8-i179","start":28,"end":37},{"id":"folio-987545ffb087f1ece898-p8-b13-0-p8-i180","type":"spatial/s